{"id":"a8","level":2,"levelName":"Ulpan Alef","n":8,"of":10,"title":"Asking","titleHe":"שְׁאֵלוֹת","goal":"Ask what, who, where, when, why and how much.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"Question words go first, and nothing else in the sentence moves — Hebrew doesn't invert word order to ask."},{"type":"examples","items":[{"he":"מָה זֶה?","en":"What is this?"},{"he":"מִי הָאִישׁ?","en":"Who is the man?"},{"he":"אֵיפֹה הַסֵּפֶר?","en":"Where is the book?"},{"he":"מָתַי אַתָּה בָּא?","en":"When are you coming?"},{"he":"לָמָּה לֹא?","en":"Why not?"},{"he":"כַּמָּה זֶה עוֹלֶה?","en":"How much does it cost?"}]},{"type":"tip","body":"A yes-or-no question is just the statement with a rising tone. הַאִם can be put at the front in writing, but speech rarely bothers."}],"vocab":[{"he":"מָה","en":"what","translit":"ma"},{"he":"מִי","en":"who","translit":"mi"},{"he":"אֵיפֹה","en":"where","translit":"eifo"},{"he":"מָתַי","en":"when","translit":"matai"},{"he":"לָמָּה","en":"why","translit":"lama"},{"he":"אֵיךְ","en":"how","translit":"eich"},{"he":"כַּמָּה","en":"how much, how many","translit":"kama"},{"he":"אֵיזֶה","en":"which","translit":"eize"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["sometimes","what","root","to give"],"correct":1,"prompt":"מָה","translit":"ma"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["noon","travels","gets dressed","who"],"correct":3,"prompt":"מִי","translit":"mi"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["where","and she said","boy","uses"],"correct":0,"prompt":"אֵיפֹה","translit":"eifo"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["when","came","explains","him, it"],"correct":0,"prompt":"מָתַי","translit":"matai"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["reading, a call","to give","why","see you, goodbye"],"correct":2,"prompt":"לָמָּה","translit":"lama"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["house","actually","the man","how"],"correct":3,"prompt":"אֵיךְ","translit":"eich"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["then","how much, how many","year","to her"],"correct":1,"prompt":"כַּמָּה","translit":"kama"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “how”?","options":["מָה","כָּאן","אֵיךְ","שְׁלוֹשָׁה"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"match","pairs":[["מָה","what"],["אֵיפֹה","where"],["כַּמָּה","how much, how many"],["מִי","who"],["אֵיזֶה","which"]]},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “which”?","options":["יָשָׁן","אֵיזֶה","מְדַבֵּר","לִי"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “when”?","options":["מָתַי","בֹּקֶר טוֹב","כִּי","מְדַבֵּר"],"correct":0,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “what”?","options":["שֶׁלָּהּ","מְבַקֵּשׁ","מָה","דִּבּוּר"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"read","he":"אֵיךְ","translit":"eich","en":"how"},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["אֵיפֹה","אֵיךְ","מָתַי","אֵיזֶה"],"correct":3,"say":"אֵיזֶה","he":true},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["אֵיךְ","מִי","כַּמָּה","אֵיזֶה"],"correct":1,"say":"מִי","he":true},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["אֵיךְ","לָמָּה","כַּמָּה","מָה"],"correct":0,"say":"אֵיךְ","he":true}]}